  "description": "Beasley is back, sporting a 6000 series alloy frame with tapered head tube, matched to a tapered alloy fork and married with an internal threadless headset. Beasley is your do anything, go anywhere solution to urban commutes and Sunday fun rides. Its 1X 8 speed semi complete Shimano drive train keeps things simple and light while its Kenda Kwick Seven.5 27.5\" x 2.0\" tires roll smooth and fast. Beasley's 32h alloy cassette hubs are laced to a pair of U-28 alloy double wall rims which also play host to a Promax \"stop on a dime\" all DSK-300 all weather mechanical disc brake set with 160mm rotors. Not to be lost in this punch bowl of spec is Beasley's understated graphics and undisputed good looks, which remain over the top.",
